  The draft specifies the date as 'October 21' (அக்டோபர் 21ஆம் தேதி), but the article only states '21st date' (21-ம் தேதி) without mentioning the month.
  The reel_script states the student lived in 'Peelamedu' (பீளமேட்டில் வசிக்கும்), but the article only says the suicide took place in Peelamedu and he studied at a school there; it does not explicitly state his residence was in Peelamedu.
